{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794848136872,"sessionID":"ses_e1abf3e70ffe7efVZgFVdgfHx6","part":{"partID":"prt_1e5491b9d001B4JGfG64cO80vu","sessionID":"ses_e1abf3e70ffe7efVZgFVdgfHx6","messageID":"msg_1e548c9d2001dJzcdq5cnreTPV","type":"tool","id":"call_f8a0d289f01d4566bfcd5bcf","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && head -20 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.10.0.0.md 2>/dev/null || ls .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog | tail -8"},"output":"---\ntitle: \"sk-doc v2.10.0.0, the create skill command is now sk-skill\"\ndescription: \"v2.10.0.0 renames `/create:skill` to `/create:sk-skill` on every runtime with no alias, so no command file is named `skill.md` and Claude Code lists all 44 tracked commands.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"sk-doc v2.10.0.0\"\n  - \"sk-doc 2.10.0.0\"\n  - \"create skill command rename\"\n  - \"sk-skill command name\"\nimportance_tier: \"normal\"\ncontextType: \"general\"\nversion: 2.10.0.0\n---\n\n# v2.10.0.0, The Create Skill Command Is Now sk-skill\n\n`/create:skill` is now `/create:sk-skill` on every runtime, with no alias. The old file name caused the bug. A command file named `skill.md` makes Claude Code read its folder as one skill. Every other command in that folder disappears from the listing.\n\n> Spec folder: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default`\n\n&nbsp;\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\ntitle: \"sk-doc v2.10.0.0, the create skill command is now sk-skill\"\ndescription: \"v2.10.0.0 renames `/create:skill` to `/create:sk-skill` on every runtime with no alias, so no command file is named `skill.md` and Claude Code lists all 44 tracked commands.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"sk-doc v2.10.0.0\"\n  - \"sk-doc 2.10.0.0\"\n  - \"create skill command rename\"\n  - \"sk-skill command name\"\nimportance_tier: \"normal\"\ncontextType: \"general\"\nversion: 2.10.0.0\n---\n\n# v2.10.0.0, The Create Skill Command Is Now sk-skill\n\n`/create:skill` is now `/create:sk-skill` on every runtime, with no alias. The old file name caused the bug. A command file named `skill.md` makes Claude Code read its folder as one skill. Every other command in that folder disappears from the listing.\n\n> Spec folder: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default`\n\n&nbsp;\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && head -20 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.10.0.0.md 2>/dev/null || ls .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog | tail -8\"}"},"time":{"start":1794848136093,"end":1794848136872}}}}
