EAD code and does each merge result work as a whole?\\n- [ ] D2 Security — does the new documentation or merge surface expose a secret, path or trust-boundary risk?\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability — spec/code alignment, cross-reference integrity, named integration surfaces\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability — stale wording, duplicated claims, future-reader cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Re-reviewing the attach/scorer code area assigned to `attach-scorer-10`; it is read-only context here.\\n- Re-reporting the recorded limits in `review-brief-10.txt` unless a new input breaks them.\\n- Running the repository build, test suite or any git write; this lineage reports only.\\n- Opening the prompt corpora except through the allowed aggregate paths; the holdout rule stays in force.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Composite convergence stop at threshold 0.10 with all four dimensions covered.\\n- `maxIterations` 8 reached without a legal convergence stop.\\n- A blocking stop from `convergence.cjs` naming an uncovered dimension or an unresolved active P0.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| [none yet] | | | |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\nFindings live in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`; this block is the running summary.\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n\\n[Populated only when an approach is tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: docs claims, merge resolutions\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Populated per iteration]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Dimension: correctness and traceability\\n- Focus area: the four docs files' changed claims against HEAD code, then each merge path's resolution against both parents\\n- Reason: init has no prior finding; the pass-ten brief assigns the docs claims and merge resolutions to this lineage\\n- Rotation status: new session, no dimension swept\\n- Required evidence: a file:line read of each claim and both sides of each merge\\n- Recovery note: none\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: the nine scope files in `review/review-scope-10.txt`; docs diff base `05f776202e0..5b2b062baef`, merge diff base `e91faf28b8c^2..e91faf28b8c`.\\n- Behavior claims: README's command-row count; SKILL's `hookHealth` sentence; the changelog's hook, no-edit and rename claims; `.env.example`'s fresh-prompt path.\\n- Reuse and conventions: the repo's generated command tables (`runtime/lib/command-attach.ts`, `command-bridges.generated.json`), the doctor symlink manifest, and the sk-doc hub version authority rule.\\n- Review risks and gaps: the merge combined main's DSH/Vibe runtime work with the branch's create-skill rename; a merged test may assert pre-merge text. The holdout corpus is out of bounds except through aggregate JSON.\\n- Out of scope: attach/scorer source assigned to `attach-scorer-10`, the recorded limits in the brief, and any file outside the nine scope paths.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | | |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | | |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | | |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | | |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | | |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | | |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/README.md` | | | | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/SKILL.md` | | | | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/changelog/v1.1.0.0.md` | | | | pending |\\n| `.env.example` | | | | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md` | | | | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/ROUTER.md` | | | | pending |\\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt` | | | | pending |\\n| `.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.1.md` | | | | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts` | | | | pending |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 8\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-docs-merge-10-1794847584683-k2l24m, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 60 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_