1/P2 set is the whole reader cost; no fifth defect. |\",\"oldString\":\"| Correctness | CONDITIONAL | 1 | Four docs claims hold; one merge pair fails as a whole (P1) and the \\\"nine\\\" count is wrong (P2). |\\n| Traceability | CONDITIONAL | 1 | Vibe is missing from both runtime enumerations (P2); the no-edit bullet overstates the gate (P2). |\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-merge-10/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794848977079,"end":1794848979037}}}}
