{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794849910483,"sessionID":"ses_e1abf3e70ffe7efVZgFVdgfHx6","part":{"partID":"prt_1e56426fc002xQVOY621ZkqJiT","sessionID":"ses_e1abf3e70ffe7efVZgFVdgfHx6","messageID":"msg_1e563fb03001j5H3DIpdJjU78P","type":"tool","id":"call_3e4ac3e39a73404db3651577","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- The sealed-row fixture count of 1 in the changelog could not be tied to one baseline field; `plain.holdout` reports own 2 and combined 2, so the sentence was left unverified rather than turned into a finding (iteration 2).\n- The iteration-3 convergence decision (`STUCK_RECOVERY`) was backfilled as a `graph_convergence_evaluated` row after synthesis, because the brief requires a decision row per iteration and the recovery event alone carried no decision or blockedBy. The row is scoped to `iteration-3`; it is a late provenance record, not a post-synthesis iteration.","oldString":"- The sealed-row fixture count of 1 in the changelog could not be tied to one baseline field; `plain.holdout` reports own 2 and combined 2, so the sentence was left unverified rather than turned into a finding (iteration 2).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-merge-10/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-merge-10/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-merge-10/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-merge-10/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-merge-10/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-merge-10/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -77,8 +77,9 @@\n \n - A first read of the doctor presentation treated the `outside the nine` sentence as a simple wording change; the accepted-runtime count only became checkable after reading the symlink manifest and the engine's unknown-name branch (iteration 1).\n - The merge file `doctor-install-presentation.txt` has no `/create:` text, so the brief's \"kept the /create:sk-skill name\" test could not apply there; the merge question had to be reframed as a test/asset pair (iteration 1).\n - The sealed-row fixture count of 1 in the changelog could not be tied to one baseline field; `plain.holdout` reports own 2 and combined 2, so the sentence was left unverified rather than turned into a finding (iteration 2).\n+- The iteration-3 convergence decision (`STUCK_RECOVERY`) was backfilled as a `graph_convergence_evaluated` row after synthesis, because the brief requires a decision row per iteration and the recovery event alone carried no decision or blockedBy. The row is scoped to `iteration-3`; it is a late provenance record, not a post-synthesis iteration.\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-merge-10/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- The sealed-row fixture count of 1 in the changelog could not be tied to one baseline field; `plain.holdout` reports own 2 and combined 2, so the sentence was left unverified rather than turned into a finding (iteration 2).\\n- The iteration-3 convergence decision (`STUCK_RECOVERY`) was backfilled as a `graph_convergence_evaluated` row after synthesis, because the brief requires a decision row per iteration and the recovery event alone carried no decision or blockedBy. The row is scoped to `iteration-3`; it is a late provenance record, not a post-synthesis iteration.\",\"oldString\":\"- The sealed-row fixture count of 1 in the changelog could not be tied to one baseline field; `plain.holdout` reports own 2 and combined 2, so the sentence was left unverified rather than turned into a finding (iteration 2).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-merge-10/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794849908476,"end":1794849910483}}}}
